# What must never end up in a published image -- above all config/local.json, which holds a
# deployment's RPC password.
#
# games/ is NOT excluded: the DOS Diversions' shareware files ship, as they do in this
# repository, and each package travels whole with its own licence text. See umbrel/Dockerfile.
.git
.github
node_modules
data
worklog
test
umbrel/blockyard
config/local.json
config/local.json.bak-*
config/blockyard.json
docs/STATE-*.md
docs/PRIVATE-*.md
docs/images
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
.claude
